# Local Development

## Setup

```bash
npm install

# Run all migrations against local D1
wrangler d1 execute egac --local --file=db/migrations/0001_initial_schema.sql
wrangler d1 execute egac --local --file=db/migrations/0002_membership_forms.sql
wrangler d1 execute egac --local --file=db/migrations/0003_update_academy_waitlist_template.sql
wrangler d1 execute egac --local --file=db/migrations/0004_coach_app.sql
wrangler d1 execute egac --local --file=db/seed.sql

# Start dev server
wrangler dev
```

Admin access: visit `/admin/login`, enter `dev` as the token. This only works when `APP_ENV === 'development'`.

## Development workflow

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Code[Write code] --> Test[npm test\n231 tests]
    Test --> Lint[npm run lint\n0 warnings]
    Lint --> Types[npx tsc --noEmit\n0 errors]
    Types --> Commit[git commit]
    Commit --> Push[git push main]
    Push --> Deploy[Cloudflare Pages\nauto-deploys]
```

## Adding a new API route

1. Create handler in `src/api/` — use `ok()` / `err()` from `helpers.ts`, `requireAdmin()` for protected routes
2. Add import and path match to `src/api/router.ts`
3. Write tests in the appropriate test file using `vi.mock()` for repos
4. Run `npm test && npm run lint`

## Adding an email template

1. Add row to `db/seed.sql` with `INSERT OR REPLACE INTO email_templates`
2. Add key to `EmailTemplateKey` union in `src/lib/db/schema.ts`
3. Add sender in `src/lib/email/templates.ts` using `getEmailTemplateByKey()`
4. Add sample vars to `SAMPLE_TEMPLATE_VARS` in `src/lib/business/templates.ts`
5. Re-run seed: `wrangler d1 execute egac --local --file=db/seed.sql`

## Adding a docs page

1. Create `src/pages/docs/my-page.astro`
2. Import and use `DocsBase` layout with `title` and `section` props
3. Add the page to `navSections` in `src/layouts/DocsBase.astro`
4. Write content using Markdown-style headings and fenced Mermaid code blocks

